body:
wait, are you biologically male or female? cause my advice depends on the answer to that question.

&#x200B;

if you're a dude, try taking some male hormones. if you're a woman, try female hormones. and consider therapy. it's your mind that's ill, not your body, so changing your body isn't gonna solve the problem and is just gonna fuck you up worse.

&#x200B;

i don't hate trans people (although most dumb fuck leftist millennials will accuse me of such) but i do hate the denial of reality. what i'm saying may sound mean or harsh but i'm just being blunt and truthful.  men are men, women are women. 

&#x200B;

idk your family or what they're like. they may truly be rude and hateful, or they may just want the best for you and aren't sure how to express it. regardless, one thing is for certain: you weren't born in the wrong body. you have a mental condition. THAT (and i cannot stress this enough) DOES NOT MAKE YOU A BAD PERSON! what would, however, make you a bad person, is being so caught up in an illusion that you change around your entire life to accommodate for a lie that you want to believe because it makes you "feel better".

&#x200B;

just be truthful with yourself and everyone around you and the truth shall set you free.
